{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And the daughter of Shua died.</b> He should have brought his daughter-in-law into his household in place of his wife, as Abraham did, as it says: וַיְבִיאֶהָ יִצְחָק הָאֹהֱלָה שָׂרָה אִמּוֹ (Genesis 24:67). Therefore Tamar despaired of his bringing her in to be his daughter-in-law again."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:33:47.247023595Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}